        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your face—if you have one—emotes differently than most creatures, making it hard for others to read your intentions and emotions. You become trained in Deception. In addition, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Deception checks to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Create a Diversion] and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Lie]. If you would automatically become trained in Deception (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.</p>"
